id: QUAL-020
title: Missing error handling after git/deploy commands in scripts
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .sh .bash
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ docs/
  content_contains: git push
patterns:
  - regex: "^\\s+git push[^|&]*$"
    message: "git push without error handling — chain with && or check $?"
  - regex: "^\\s+git tag[^|&]*$"
    message: "git tag without error handling — chain with && or check $?"
fix: Use && chaining or explicit error handling for git operations that should not be ignored
